WEBVTT

00:04:27.708 --> 00:04:31.278
even before COVID-19 was declared 
a pandemic.

00:04:31.278 --> 00:04:34.268
These tests— along with the scientists 
who develop them

00:04:34.268 --> 00:04:36.738
and the health professionals 
who administer them—

00:04:36.738 --> 00:04:39.028
are absolutely essential.

00:04:39.028 --> 00:04:43.258
And when deployed early, 
they can save millions of lives.